      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>The keyword turns the function into a generator: calling it returns an iterator\nrather than running the body. Each value is produced on demand.</p>\n<pre><code>&gt;&gt;&gt; gen = counter(3)\n&gt;&gt;&gt; next(gen)\n0\n&gt;&gt;&gt; list(gen)\n[1, 2]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Nothing runs until the first value is requested, so memory stays constant.</p>"
    },
    {
