      "answer_id": 231801,
      "question_id": 231767,
      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>Worth adding that a generator is single-use. Once it is exhausted it does not\nrestart, so iterate it twice and the second pass sees nothing.</p>"
